# A shot cropped around one tile: tile 21,4 on the map view, with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   --map --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --play play/cropped-shot.play
# tile-whole is the whole frame; tile is the tiles within 2 steps of 21,4 and the room above them for the tallest
# object sprite, enlarged twice.
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
shot tile-whole
shot tile 21 4 2 2
